<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Triumph Scrambler 400 X - Periodic Care & Maintenance Sheet</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #c1121f;
      --primary-dark: #780000;
      --dark: #1f2421;
      --light-bg: #f8f9fa;
      --border-color: #dee2e6;
      --text-muted: #555555;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      color: var(--dark);
      background-color: #ffffff;
      line-height: 1.4;
      font-size: 13px;
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .no-print-bar {
      background: #e9ecef;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .btn-print {
      background-color: var(--primary);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      padding: 8px 18px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .btn-print:hover {
      background-color: var(--primary-dark);
    }

    header {
      border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary);
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 22px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: var(--primary);
    }

    .subtitle {
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    .meta-box {
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--text-muted);
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 14px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      background-color: var(--light-bg);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      margin-top: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .caution-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .caution-card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px;
      background: var(--light-bg);
    }

    .caution-card strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .caution-card p {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #333;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    th, td {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding: 6px 8px;
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: middle;
    }

    th {
      background-color: #f1f3f5;
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }

    td {
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }

    .col-freq {
      width: 14%;
      font-weight: 600;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .col-target {
      width: 20%;
      font-weight: 500;
    }

    .col-tool {
      width: 22%;
      color: #444;
    }

    .col-task {
      width: 38%;
    }

    .col-box {
      width: 6%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .checkbox-square {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 13px;
      height: 13px;
      border: 1.5px solid #666;
      border-radius: 2px;
    }

    .rules-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: 11.5px;
    }

    .rule-box {
      border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
    }

    .rule-box.do {
      border-left: 4px solid #2b9348;
    }

    .rule-box.dont {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
    }

    .rule-box h3 {
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .rule-box.do h3 { color: #2b9348; }
    .rule-box.dont h3 { color: var(--primary); }

    .rule-box ul {
      padding-left: 16px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .rule-box li {
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 18px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color);
      padding-top: 8px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #888;
    }

    @media print {
      body {
        padding: 0;
        font-size: 11.5px;
      }
      .no-print-bar {
        display: none !important;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 100%;
      }
      @page {
        size: A4 portrait;
        margin: 10mm 12mm 10mm 12mm;
      }
      tr {
        page-break-inside: avoid;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">

  <div class="no-print-bar">
    <span><strong>Print Layout Ready:</strong> Click the button to download or print this as a PDF.</span>
    <button class="btn-print" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button>
  </div>

  <header>
    <div>
      <h1>Triumph Scrambler 400 X</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">Periodic Cleaning & Technical Care Blueprint (398cc TR-Series)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="meta-box">
      <div><strong>Finish:</strong> Carnival Red</div>
      <div><strong>Location Profile:</strong> Urban / Dust-Prone</div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <h2>1. Critical Hardware Caution Zones</h2>
  <div class="caution-grid">
    <div class="caution-card">
      <strong>Zone A: Cluster</strong>
      <p>Low pressure only. Keep water away from the USB-C flap & switchgear cubes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="caution-card">
      <strong>Zone B: Radiator</strong>
      <p>Spray strictly front-to-back. No angled high pressure (>100 bar) on thin fins.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="caution-card">
      <strong>Zone C: Cat-Con</strong>
      <p>45-min cooldown required. Never spray cold tap water onto hot exhaust pipes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="caution-card">
      <strong>Zone D: Drive Chain</strong>
      <p>Use Kerosene or dedicated chain spray. Never use petrol, diesel, or wire brushes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="caution-card">
      <strong>Zone E: Monoshock</strong>
      <p>Zero direct pressure jets on the chrome shaft. Protect rubber dust wiper seal.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h2>2. Maintenance & Care Checklist</h2>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th class="col-freq">Frequency</th>
        <th class="col-target">Target Area</th>
        <th class="col-tool">Tools / Chemicals</th>
        <th class="col-task">Action & Verification</th>
        <th class="col-box">Done</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Daily (2 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Front Forks</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Dry Microfiber Cloth</td>
        <td class="col-task">Wipe dust rings & dried insects off gold stanchions to save seals.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Daily (2 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Headlamp & Mirrors</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Damp Microfiber Towel</td>
        <td class="col-task">Clean bugs & grime off round LED headlamp and rearview mirrors.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Weekly (15 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Body Panels</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Two Buckets + pH Soap</td>
        <td class="col-task">Hand-wash Carnival Red tank, rims & chassis. Dry with plush towel.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Weekly (15 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Fluid Windows</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Visual Inspection</td>
        <td class="col-task">Check oil sight glass (bike upright) and coolant reservoir level.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Bi-Weekly (20 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Drive Chain Clean</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Grunge Brush + Kerosene</td>
        <td class="col-task">Engine OFF, neutral. Scrub gunk off links; wipe completely dry.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Bi-Weekly (20 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Drive Chain Lube</td>
        <td class="col-tool">O-Ring Chain Lubricant</td>
        <td class="col-task">Coat inside of warm chain rollers. Let cure 4-6 hours before riding.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Monthly (45 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Rear Shock Cavity</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Soft Brush + Diluted Soap</td>
        <td class="col-task">Clean spring coils & lower linkage. Gently trickle rinse with water.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Monthly (45 min)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Radiator Matrix</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Diluted APC + Low Flow</td>
        <td class="col-task">Flush mud & crushed insects from cooling matrix front-to-back.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Quarterly (3 Mo)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Carnival Red Tank</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Carnauba Wax / Sealant</td>
        <td class="col-task">Apply UV sealant layer over tank clear coat to avoid swirl haze.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Quarterly (3 Mo)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Black Trim Plastics</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Water-based UV Dresser</td>
        <td class="col-task">Condition front beak, rear hugger & switch housings. No grease.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Quarterly (3 Mo)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Frame & Fasteners</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Anti-Corrosion Mist (ACF)</td>
        <td class="col-task">Wipe bolt heads, footpeg pins & subframe joints with treated rag.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Half-Yearly (6 Mo)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Battery Terminals</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Brass Brush + Dielectric</td>
        <td class="col-task">Remove seat, clean post oxidation, apply protective dielectric coat.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Half-Yearly (6 Mo)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Pivots & Linkages</td>
        <td class="col-tool">White Lithium Grease</td>
        <td class="col-task">Lubricate side-stand spring hinge and rider footpeg spring pivots.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td class="col-freq">Yearly (Annual)</td>
        <td class="col-target">Deep Decontamination</td>
        <td class="col-tool">Clay Bar + Ceramic Coat</td>
        <td class="col-task">Remove embedded industrial fallout & tar from tank; seal clear coat.</td>
        <td class="col-box"><span class="checkbox-square"></span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>3. Golden Rules for the Scrambler 400 X</h2>
  <div class="rules-grid">
    <div class="rule-box do">
      <h3>Do</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Let engine & exhaust header cool completely before washing to avoid thermal shock.</li>
        <li>Place a cardboard shield behind the chain when spraying lube to shield the rear tire & brake rotor.</li>
        <li>Rotate rear wheel strictly by hand while cleaning or lubing the chain.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="rule-box dont">
      <h3>Don't</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Never point high-pressure water directly at wheel hubs, steering head bearings, or shock seals.</li>
        <li>Never use household dishwash soap or clothes detergents (they strip wax & dry out rubber O-rings).</li>
        <li>Never run the bike in gear on a paddock stand while cleaning the driveline.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <footer>
    <span>Triumph Scrambler 400 X Field Service & Maintenance Protocol</span>
    <span>Print & Pin to Garage Wall</span>
  </footer>

</div>

<script>
  // Automatically trigger print dialog on desktop browsers
  window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    // Small delay to allow styling to settle
    setTimeout(() => {
      window.print();
    }, 400);
  });
</script>

</body>
</html>
